cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this artifact, please cite it. The artifact contains the code that
  produces the measurements; it deliberately ships no measurements of its own.
title: "PSAO: reproducibility artifact for predictive security-aware offloading of JWT verification"
abstract: >-
  Instrumentation, load-generation harnesses, a running controller
  implementation and an analysis pipeline for measuring event-loop saturation in
  a Node.js microservice under layered Zero Trust enforcement (Edge TLS, Istio
  mTLS, application-level JWT validation with HS256 and RS256) on Kubernetes,
  and for evaluating PSAO, a policy that relocates token verification to the
  Envoy sidecar before the saturation point is reached. The repository produces
  measurements; the only numeric data it ships is clearly labelled synthetic
  example data used to exercise the pipeline.
type: software
